This software contains cryptographic protocol constants (FRAME_MAGIC,
FRAME_VERSION, CHANNEL_INVITE_PREFIX, and associated KDF domain labels)
derived from a two-party commitment ceremony conducted in 2025. These
constants are irreproducible and form part of the GhostWire network
identity. Nodes compiled without these constants cannot participate in
a GhostWire mesh network.

Built on: libp2p, vodozemac, ml-kem, axum, and other open source
components. See Cargo.toml for the full dependency tree and their
respective licenses.
